list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/sustainability/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">Sustainability</a><li class=nav__bottom-wrap><div class=nav__bottom><div class=nav__share-price><div class=share-price><span class=share-price__text>LSE:</span> <a href="/investors/shareholder-information/share-price-and-tools/" class=share-price__link> <span class=share-price__price>235.00</span> <span class=share-price__currency>p</span> </a> <span class=share-price__time>17:20 BST</span></div></div><div class="nav__list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/news-insights/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">News &amp; Insights</a></div><div class="nav__list-item js-nav-item" aria-haspopup=true><a href="/contacts/" class="nav__link js-nav-link">Contacts</a></div></div></ul></nav><div class=header__search><button class="header__search-btn radius-sm js-search-button" type=button><span class="zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span><span class=sr-only>Search Button</span></button><div class="search-popup js-search-popup"><div class=wrap><form class="search-popup__form js-search-form" action="/search/"><div class=search-popup__input-wrap><span class="search-popup__search-icon zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span> <label class="search-popup__label sr-only" for=search>Search</label> <input class="search-popup__input js-search-input-header" id=search name=term type=search placeholder=Search autocomplete=off> <button class="search-popup__reset js-search-reset" aria-label="Reset serach" type=button> <span class="zmdi zmdi-close icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </button></div><button class="search-popup__submit btn radius-sm"> <span class=search-popup__btn-text>Search</span> <span class="zmdi zmdi-search icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </button></form></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><main class=main id=main><div class="breadcrumbs breadcrumbs--left-align js-breadcrumbs" role=navigation aria-label="Breadcrumb navigation" data-script=breadcrumbs><div class=breadcrumbs__wrapper><ul class=breadcrumbs__list><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/" data-script=external-links>Home</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class=breadcrumbs__link-wrap> <a class=breadcrumbs__link href="/careers/" data-script=external-links>Careers</a> <span class="zmdi zmdi-chevron-right icon" aria-hidden=true></span> </span><li class=breadcrumbs__item><span class="breadcrumbs__link-wrap breadcrumbs__link-wrap--active" aria-current=page>Trainee Broker Programme</span></ul></div></div><section class="global-banner global-banner--left-align section section--bg-secondary section--text-light"><picture class=global-banner__picture> <img loading=lazy class=global-banner__image src="/media/mumbb2pt/braemar_eoy-report-094.webp?rxy=0.6116373477672531,0.29751815304790535&amp;width=2688&amp;height=700&amp;v=1dc320991fc5580&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture><div class=global-banner__overlay style=opacity:50%;background-color:#000000 aria-hidden=true></div><div class="wrap wrap--narrow"><div class=global-banner__content><h1 class="global-banner__title headline h1">Trainee Broker Programme</h1><p class="global-banner__description body-text standfirst">Watch this space for the next application round</div></div></section><section class="zigzag section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">Introduction</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><p class=MsoNormal>Broking is a fast-paced, results-driven profession that offers a unique and rewarding career in global markets, whether your focus is Shipping or Commodities.<p class=MsoNormal>Global trade relies on both the movement of goods and the markets that price them – so brokers play a key role in shaping the industry.<p class=MsoNormal>It’s a dynamic and fulfilling career, where no two days are the same, and every day brings the opportunity to make a real impact.</div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/0xdnsyyp/braemar_eoy-report-080.webp?rxy=0.49999589325755023,0.46179525922601933&amp;width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dc320991a7f3f0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/0xdnsyyp/braemar_eoy-report-080.webp?rxy=0.49999589325755023,0.46179525922601933&amp;width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dc320991a7f3f0&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><div class="quote quote--image quote--narrow section--text-light"><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class="quote__wrapper section section--bg-secondary module-radius-lg"><div class=quote__content-wrap><blockquote class="quote__description headline h4">"Shipbroking is very global, everchanging, there’s dynamism and a lot of variety, and there is always something to learn"</blockquote><strong class="quote__author headline h6">Jay Parvin</strong><p class="quote__job-position body-text text-large">Trainee Shipbroker</div><div class=quote__image-wrap><picture class=quote__picture><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/hmln2glq/jay.webp?width=770&amp;height=518&amp;v=1dc11d4b68dfd90&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class=quote__image src="/media/hmln2glq/jay.webp?width=807&amp;height=723&amp;v=1dc11d4b68dfd90&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></div><section class="zigzag zigzag--reverse section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">The role</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><div class=text><p>Shipbrokers are specialist intermediaries who facilitate the movement of goods products and negotiate between shipowners and charterers.<p>Commodities brokers operate in market-driven environments helping clients trade and manage risk.</div></div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/omgku1ya/dscf4472.webp?rxy=0.5017911750378871,0.36331554539746463&amp;width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dcc10e3ba95bd0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/omgku1ya/dscf4472.webp?rxy=0.5017911750378871,0.36331554539746463&amp;width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dcc10e3ba95bd0&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><section class="zigzag section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">What it takes</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><div class=text><p>It takes drive, ambition and dedication to become a successful broker so if that sounds like you, we encourage you to apply to join our Trainee broker Programme.<p>Successful brokers develop long-term relationships with clients, built on trust and high-quality service.  A strong work ethic is essential as you’ll be expected to deliver value and results early on.<p>We invest in your development, so we are looking for people who are highly motivated with a drive to succeed.</div></div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/4bclhlc4/adobe-express-2025-08-19-150955.webp?width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dc19043fb592a0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/4bclhlc4/adobe-express-2025-08-19-150955.webp?width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dc19043fb592a0&amp;format=webp" alt="Braemar Office banner"> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><section class="zigzag zigzag--reverse section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">Our Programme</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><div class=text><div class=text><p>Our trainee broker programme is designed to equip you with the skills and experience needed to develop a strong foundation and career in shipping or in commodities.<p>From day one, you will begin building those foundations and be immersed in the fast-paced world of broking, gaining hands-on experience and working alongside some of the best brokers in the market.<p>Collaboration and strong communication are central to success, and you will quickly become an active member of the team.<p>You’ll learn how to build trusted relationships and work effectively with colleagues across desks.  Our programme prioritises teamwork and offers broad exposure to different markets, sectors and clients.</div></div></div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/qjrbadby/2022_04_07_st_brae_recce__0211.webp?width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dc1b392b8710b0&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/qjrbadby/2022_04_07_st_brae_recce__0211.webp?width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dc1b392b8710b0&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><section class="zigzag section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=zigzag__wrapper><div class=zigzag__text-content><h2 class="zigzag__title headline h3">Qualifications</h2><div class="zigzag__description rte body-text text-large"><div class=text><div class=text><p>You do not need any specific degree or professional qualification to become a broker.<p>We are looking for people with drive, curiosity and commitment – people with character and capability to thrive in a fast-paced, results-driven environment.<p>You will however, need to demonstrate a genuine interest and understanding of the global shipping and commodities markets.</div></div></div></div><div class=zigzag__media><div class=zigzag__media-wrap><picture class="zigzag__image module-radius-md"><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/4tyl4gml/philip-tandoh.webp?rxy=0.5090077442808689,0.25776522225109066&amp;width=684&amp;height=390&amp;v=1dcc10eb0059110&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class="picture__img image" src="/media/4tyl4gml/philip-tandoh.webp?rxy=0.5090077442808689,0.25776522225109066&amp;width=869&amp;height=504&amp;v=1dcc10eb0059110&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><div class="statistics statistics--center section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=statistics__wrapper><div class=statistics__text-content><h2 class="statistics__title headline h3">Our values</h2></div><div class=statistics__items-wrap><div class=statistics__items><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/sgnalwu2/experience-2.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">Integrity<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Principled performance driven by trust, diversity and integrity&nbsp;</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/0pxbyey5/investing-2.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">Delivery<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Delivering excellence beyond expectations</div></div><div class=statistics__item><img class=statistics__icon src=/media/onxkqptn/teamwork.svg alt=""><p class="statistics__statistic h2">Resilience<div class="statistics__item-title headline h6"><p>Progress through persistence, turning challenges into opportunities to accelerate growth</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div></div><div class="text-block section section--bg-white section--text-dark"><div class="spacer spacer--small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=rte data-script=rte><h4>Next Steps and application</h4></div></div></div><section class="timeline section section--text-dark js-timeline" data-script=timeline><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class=wrap><div class=timeline__wrapper><div class=timeline__items><div class="timeline__item js-timeline-item"><h3 class="timeline__year h3">1</h3><h4 class="h5 headline">Submit your application</h4><div class="body-text standfirst"><div class=rte><p>&nbsp;The next application round will open in 2027<span>.</span></div></div></div><div class="timeline__item js-timeline-item"><h3 class="timeline__year h3">2</h3><h4 class="h5 headline">Virtual interview</h4><div class="body-text standfirst"><div class=rte><p>If shortlisted, you’ll have a one-to-one interview with our recruitment team to explore your motivation and skills for a career in shipping or commodities broking.</div></div></div><div class="timeline__item js-timeline-item"><h3 class="timeline__year h3">3</h3><h4 class="h5 headline">Desk interviews</h4><div class="body-text standfirst"><div class=rte><p>You’ll meet HR and a broker from one of our desks (virtual or in person).</div></div></div><div class="timeline__item js-timeline-item"><h3 class="timeline__year h3">4</h3><h4 class="h5 headline">Final round</h4><div class="body-text standfirst"><div class=rte><p>In-person interviews at our London office with Desk Heads and HR.<p>Offers will be made following this stage.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div></section><section class="cta-block cta-block--image section section--text-light"><div class="spacer spacer--extra-small" aria-hidden=true></div><div class="cta-block__holder section section--bg-secondary"><div class=wrap><div class=cta-block__wrapper><div class=cta-block__text-content><h2 class="cta-block__title headline h2">Watch this space for the next application round</h2></div><div class=cta-block__media><div class=cta-block__media-wrap><picture class=cta-block__picture><source media=(max-width:767px) srcset="/media/qx1dxmfz/david-eaves_nick-hargreaves_combine.webp?rxy=0.4965355371214689,0.2625019336111667&amp;width=460&amp;height=308&amp;v=1dc320bcc5dca40&amp;format=webp"><img loading=lazy class=cta-block__image src="/media/qx1dxmfz/david-eaves_nick-hargreaves_combine.webp?rxy=0.4965355371214689,0.2625019336111667&amp;width=1165&amp;v=1dc320bcc5dca40&amp;format=webp" alt=""> </picture></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=footer><div class=footer__top><div class=wrap><div class=footer__top-wrap><div class=footer__overview><a class=footer__logo-holder href="/" aria-label="Home page link"> <img class=footer__logo src="/media/bdyfw1yz/braemar-logo-dark.png?format=webp" alt=""> </a><div class="footer__text rte"><p class=text-large>Built on experience.&nbsp;Driven by insight.</div></div><ul class="footer__col footer__nav" aria-label="Quick Links"><li class=footer__col-title>Quick Links<li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/"> Home </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/about-us/"> About Us </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/services/"> Services </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/investors/"> Investors </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/careers/"> Careers </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/sustainability/"> Sustainability </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/news-insights/"> News &amp; Insights </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/contacts/"> Contacts </a></ul><ul class="footer__col footer__tools" aria-label="Site Tools"><li class=footer__col-title>Site Tools<li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/sitemap/"> Sitemap </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/disclaimer/"> Disclaimer </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/privacy-policy/"> Privacy Policy </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/cookie-policy/"> Cookie Policy </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/copyright/"> Copyright </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/terms-and-conditions/"> Terms &amp; Conditions </a><li class=footer__nav-item><a class=footer__nav-link href="/disclosures-regulatory/"> Regulatory Disclosures </a><li class="footer__nav-item footer__nav-item--cookie"><button class="footer__nav-link js-cookie-settings-button" type=button> Cookie Settings </button></ul><a class="footer__skip-button btn btn--sm radius-sm js-skip-to-top" data-script=skip-to-top data-scroll href=#main> <span class="zmdi icon icon--back-to-top-left" aria-hidden=true></span> <span>Scroll to Top</span> <span class="zmdi icon icon--back-to-top-right" aria-hidden=true></span> </a></div></div></div><div class=footer__bottom><div class=wrap><div class=footer__bottom-wrap><p class="footer__copyright text">&#169; 2026 Braemar PLC. All rights reserved.<ul class=footer__social-links aria-label="Social Media Links"><li class=footer__social-link-item><a class=footer__social-link href=https://www.linkedin.com/company/braemar-ltd target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer"> <span class="zmdi zmdi-linkedin icon"></span> <span class=sr-only>zmdi-linkedin</span> </a></ul></div></div></div></footer><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v4bc70e2c01a94c73b74392e4234840661791215815920" integrity="sha512-L0ha0OXavK/8okipN9F8BtP84dg9DUhPERbBXzwI6dgTA55d2+yweo3pn5CSFYs45/r8md2+xvUPtTdvTNRfjA==" nonce="Y98mQyiUB1cRRT+54o8lX5V/YowxroBCIiJDHHFfm+Y=" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"97d50cf984c9416098c5464acc3c2d4e","spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
